{"seq":3,"slug":"automated-releases","title":"自动化发布","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-engineering/ci-cd-and-automation/automated-releases","wordCount":351,"readingTime":2,"html":"<h1 id=\"自动化发布\">自动化发布</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>在一个 Monorepo 中，发布涉及多个层面的决策：哪些包需要发布？版本号如何确定？CHANGELOG 如何生成？npm 包如何发布？应用如何部署？手动管理这些流程既容易出错，又难以规模化。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    CODE[代码变更] --&gt; CHANGE[记录变更]&#10;    CHANGE --&gt; VERSION[确定版本]&#10;    VERSION --&gt; CHANGELOG[生成 CHANGELOG]&#10;    CHANGELOG --&gt; PUBLISH[发布 npm 包]&#10;    PUBLISH --&gt; TAG[Git Tag]&#10;    TAG --&gt; RELEASE[GitHub Release]&#10;    RELEASE --&gt; DEPLOY[应用部署]\">flowchart TD\n    CODE[代码变更] --&gt; CHANGE[记录变更]\n    CHANGE --&gt; VERSION[确定版本]\n    VERSION --&gt; CHANGELOG[生成 CHANGELOG]\n    CHANGELOG --&gt; PUBLISH[发布 npm 包]\n    PUBLISH --&gt; TAG[Git Tag]\n    TAG --&gt; RELEASE[GitHub Release]\n    RELEASE --&gt; DEPLOY[应用部署]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"changesets-工作流\">Changesets 工作流</h2><p>Changesets 是 Monorepo 场景中最成熟的版本管理工具。它将版本管理分为两个阶段：日常开发中&quot;记录变更&quot;，发布时&quot;消费变更&quot;。</p>\n<h3 id=\"安装配置\">安装配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"pnpm add -D @changesets/cli @changesets/changelog-github&#10;npx changeset init\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pnpm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -D</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> @changesets/cli</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> @changesets/changelog-github</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> changeset</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> init</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"// .changeset/config.json&#10;{&#10;  &quot;$schema&quot;: &quot;https://unpkg.com/@changesets/config@3.0.0/schema.json&quot;,&#10;  &quot;changelog&quot;: [&quot;@changesets/changelog-github&quot;, { &quot;repo&quot;: &quot;org/frontend-platform&quot; }],&#10;  &quot;commit&quot;: false,&#10;  &quot;fixed&quot;: [],&#10;  &quot;linked&quot;: [[&quot;@myapp/ui&quot;, &quot;@myapp/shared&quot;]],&#10;  &quot;access&quot;: &quot;restricted&quot;,&#10;  &quot;baseBranch&quot;: &quot;main&quot;,&#10;  &quot;updateInternalDependencies&quot;: &quot;patch&quot;,&#10;  &quot;ignore&quot;: [&quot;@myapp/web&quot;, &quot;@myapp/admin&quot;]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// .changeset/config.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"$schema\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://unpkg.com/@changesets/config@3.0.0/schema.json\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"changelog\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@changesets/changelog-github\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"repo\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"org/frontend-platform\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"commit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"fixed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"linked\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@myapp/ui\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@myapp/shared\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"access\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"restricted\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"baseBranch\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"main\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"updateInternalDependencies\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"patch\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"ignore\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@myapp/web\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@myapp/admin\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"日常工作流\">日常工作流</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant DEV as 开发者&#10;    participant REPO as 代码仓库&#10;    participant CI as CI 流水线&#10;    participant NPM as npm Registry&#10;&#10;    DEV-&gt;&gt;REPO: 提交代码&#10;    DEV-&gt;&gt;REPO: npx changeset (记录变更)&#10;    REPO--&gt;&gt;REPO: .changeset/xxx.md 文件&#10;    DEV-&gt;&gt;REPO: 合并到 main&#10;    CI-&gt;&gt;CI: 检测到 changeset 文件&#10;    CI-&gt;&gt;REPO: 创建 Release PR&#10;    Note over CI,REPO: PR 中包含版本号更新和 CHANGELOG&#10;    DEV-&gt;&gt;REPO: Review &amp; 合并 Release PR&#10;    CI-&gt;&gt;NPM: 自动发布 npm 包&#10;    CI-&gt;&gt;REPO: 创建 Git Tag 和 GitHub Release\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant DEV as 开发者\n    participant REPO as 代码仓库\n    participant CI as CI 流水线\n    participant NPM as npm Registry\n\n    DEV-&gt;&gt;REPO: 提交代码\n    DEV-&gt;&gt;REPO: npx changeset (记录变更)\n    REPO--&gt;&gt;REPO: .changeset/xxx.md 文件\n    DEV-&gt;&gt;REPO: 合并到 main\n    CI-&gt;&gt;CI: 检测到 changeset 文件\n    CI-&gt;&gt;REPO: 创建 Release PR\n    Note over CI,REPO: PR 中包含版本号更新和 CHANGELOG\n    DEV-&gt;&gt;REPO: Review &amp; 合并 Release PR\n    CI-&gt;&gt;NPM: 自动发布 npm 包\n    CI-&gt;&gt;REPO: 创建 Git Tag 和 GitHub Release</pre><h3 id=\"记录变更\">记录变更</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"npx changeset\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> changeset</span></span></code></pre></div><p>执行后会交互式地询问：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>哪些包受到了影响？</li>\n<li>是 major、minor 还是 patch 变更？</li>\n<li>变更的描述是什么？</li>\n</ol>\n<p>生成的 changeset 文件：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"markdown\" data-code=\"---&#10;&#39;@myapp/ui&#39;: minor&#10;&#39;@myapp/shared&#39;: patch&#10;---&#10;&#10;新增 DatePicker 组件，支持日期选择和范围选择。更新了 shared 包中的日期格式化工具函数。\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'@myapp/ui'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">minor</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'@myapp/shared'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">patch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">新增 DatePicker 组件，支持日期选择和范围选择。更新了 shared 包中的日期格式化工具函数。</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"语义化版本-semver\">语义化版本（Semver）</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    MAJOR[&quot;Major (1.0.0)&lt;br/&gt;破坏性变更&lt;br/&gt;不兼容的 API 修改&quot;] --- MINOR[&quot;Minor (0.1.0)&lt;br/&gt;新功能&lt;br/&gt;向后兼容&quot;] --- PATCH[&quot;Patch (0.0.1)&lt;br/&gt;Bug 修复&lt;br/&gt;向后兼容&quot;]\">graph LR\n    MAJOR[\"Major (1.0.0)&lt;br/&gt;破坏性变更&lt;br/&gt;不兼容的 API 修改\"] --- MINOR[\"Minor (0.1.0)&lt;br/&gt;新功能&lt;br/&gt;向后兼容\"] --- PATCH[\"Patch (0.0.1)&lt;br/&gt;Bug 修复&lt;br/&gt;向后兼容\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>变更类型</th>\n<th>版本影响</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>新增组件/API</td>\n<td>Minor</td>\n<td>新增 <code>DatePicker</code> 组件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>新增可选参数</td>\n<td>Minor</td>\n<td><code>Button</code> 新增 <code>loading</code> props</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>修复 Bug</td>\n<td>Patch</td>\n<td>修复 <code>Modal</code> 在 Safari 中的滚动问题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能优化</td>\n<td>Patch</td>\n<td>优化 <code>Table</code> 大数据量渲染性能</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>删除/重命名 API</td>\n<td>Major</td>\n<td>移除 <code>Button</code> 的 <code>type</code> prop</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>修改默认行为</td>\n<td>Major</td>\n<td><code>Select</code> 默认值从 <code>null</code> 改为 <code>undefined</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"自动化发布-ci\">自动化发布 CI</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# .github/workflows/release.yml&#10;name: Release&#10;&#10;on:&#10;  push:&#10;    branches: [main]&#10;&#10;permissions:&#10;  contents: write&#10;  pull-requests: write&#10;  id-token: write&#10;&#10;jobs:&#10;  release:&#10;    name: Release&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - name: Checkout&#10;        uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;&#10;      - name: Setup pnpm&#10;        uses: pnpm/action-setup@v4&#10;&#10;      - name: Setup Node.js&#10;        uses: actions/setup-node@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          node-version: 20&#10;          cache: &#39;pnpm&#39;&#10;          registry-url: &#39;https://registry.npmjs.org&#39;&#10;&#10;      - name: Install Dependencies&#10;        run: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile&#10;&#10;      - name: Build&#10;        run: pnpm run build&#10;&#10;      - name: Create Release PR or Publish&#10;        uses: changesets/action@v1&#10;        with:&#10;          publish: pnpm run release&#10;          version: pnpm run version&#10;          title: &#39;chore: release packages&#39;&#10;          commit: &#39;chore: release packages&#39;&#10;        env:&#10;          GITHUB_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }}&#10;          NPM_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.NPM_TOKEN }}&#10;          NODE_AUTH_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.NPM_TOKEN }}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># .github/workflows/release.yml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Release</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    branches</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">permissions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  contents</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">write</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  pull-requests</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">write</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  id-token</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#